Wrong.
Blessed  = good luck
uncursed = good luck
cursed   = bad luck

Now: if your luck changes from the default value (normally 0, modified by moon)
it will decay with time towards the default value. The luckstone can prevent 
this in the following way:
blessed  - sustains good luck, bad luck decays
uncursed - sustains luck, be it good or bad
cursed   - good luck decays, sustains bad luck.

Thus having your luckstone cursed whey you have build a high luck is bad...
